WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.800
Save a backup, and bring it back.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.900
A backup is the one safety net.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.300
Everything V.O.I.C.E. knows about a learner
lives only on the iPad.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.800
A backup is the one safety net.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.200
It is a single file you keep.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.400
Hold the adult circle for 3 seconds

7
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.000
and enter your passcode.

8
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.000
Open Backup.

9
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Save the file somewhere safe,

10
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.800
like the Files app or iCloud Drive.

11
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.800
To bring a learner back, or move to a new iPad,

12
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.600
open V.O.I.C.E. and choose
Restore from a backup file.

13
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.800
Clearing Safari’s website data erases
V.O.I.C.E.’s learners, settings and photos,

14
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.200
so save a new backup now and then,
and after any big change.

15
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.800
A backup file is not encrypted,
so keep it somewhere safe.

16
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
